  "worked_solution": "The figure consists of $4$ rows, and each row has $2$ cubes.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14132963/assets/3ce44c9a2ee70c001e79a93ea4992599f49ee60410983ca95c85f3e5b08f8abc.png)\n\nSo, there are $2\\times 4=8$ cubes in total.\n\nTherefore, the volume of the figure is $8$ cubic centimeters.",
